about-gpui-github = I-GPUI ku-GitHub
about-personal-title = Iphrojekthi yomuntu siqu
about-personal-text = I-Katna Mail ayizami ukuba yintsha noma ibe yinguquko enkulu. Uhlelo lokusebenza lwemeyili umbhali walo ayelufuna, futhi izici nokubukeka kwalo kubolekwe ku-Gmail, i-Mailspring ne-Thunderbird. Kwenzeka kuphela ngenxa yokuthi ama-LLM aqhubekele phambili kangakanani.
